<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>ELO scores under expert mode. The rankings appear non-consecutive, since we display only the key models and preserve their original positions from the full leaderboard.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S6.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Public Mode Evaluation Results.</span> As shown in Table <a href="#S6.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 6.2 ELO Score ‣ 6 Experimental Result ‣ MEF: A Systematic Evaluation Framework for Text-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, Seedream 3.0 achieves the best overall performance and ranks first, followed closely by GPT-4o. At the scenario level, Seedream 3.0 consistently outperforms in Art, Functional Design, Aesthetic Design, and Film, while GPT-4o achieves its best results in Functional Design, Film, and Entertainment. The tier of remaining models is consistent with the expert-mode ELO results.</p>
</div>
