<span id="A2.T11.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Entity</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Semantic units referring to entities such as people, animals, scenes, costumes, and decorations, including real-world and virtual entities, man-made objects, and natural elements.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">A little <span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">girl</span> in a <span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">dress</span> walking her pet <span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">dog</span> in a <span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">park</span> encounters a <span id="A2.T11.2.2.4.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">robot</span>.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Entity Description</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Semantic units describing the quantity, attributes, forms, states, or relationships of entities.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Three</span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> children dressed in </span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">jeans</span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> are </span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">playing jump rope</span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, while </span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">several pink</span><span id="A2.T11.2.3.4.1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> roses are in full bloom beside them.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Image Description</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Semantic units that describe visual elements of a scene, including style, aesthetics, and artistic knowledge.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
