<span id="A2.T11.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Element Composition</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Anti-Realism</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Combinations that contradict real-world cognition or physical laws.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">A ceramic cup floating in the air.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
