<span id="A2.T11.2.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.6.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">A poster with the word ”TOPIC” at the top and ”Love &amp; Peace” at the bottom.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
