</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.7.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Multiple entities of the same type with distinct attribute values.</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T11.2.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:8.0pt;padding-right:8.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.7.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T11.2.7.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Three purple gemstones</span><span id="A2.T11.2.7.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><span id="A2.T11.2.7.4.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">one pink gemstone</span><span id="A2.T11.2.7.4.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
